	(text "ROW3: window DRV down - window PASS up - window PASS down   ROW4: mirror defog - spare - spare" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 130 34 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0fed174d-2ce2-4950-80df-c4bdee6d8a63"))
	(text "The window switches are centre-sprung DPDT: one pole per direction, so DRV up (ROW2/COL3) and DRV down (ROW3/COL1)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 130 38 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b3354236-ee33-4099-ac67-41a8ecec38e8"))
	(text "are two independent keys; an SPDT's single common cannot reach two rows and two columns without a phantom key." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 130 42 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6a529254-6bd8-42b9-b872-2637a9b3d32a"))
